{
  "_comment": "Tasks GOAL TABLE — the two lists behind the lobby's Tasks screen. achievements[] are permanent CHAINS: one entry per tracked activity, whose tiers[] are ascending targets scored against the player's LIFETIME counter for that activity, so only one unfinished tier per chain is ever on screen and finishing several at once makes them all claimable at once. weekly[] are flat one-shot goals scored against the same counters since the start of the current week; they all reset together every Monday. activity: which counter the row watches — levelsCompleted|tilesMatched|propsUsed|undoUsed|shuffleUsed|wandUsed|coinsSpent|dailyBonusClaimed|wheelSpins|shopPurchases (propsUsed is the combined undo+shuffle+wand total; coinsSpent counts the AMOUNT spent, not the number of purchases; tilesMatched counts a level's WHOLE tile count when that level is completed, so an abandoned or lost attempt counts nothing). target: what the counter has to reach. reward: one item stack, type coins|undo|wand|shuffle (this port's Hint helper is 'wand'), exactly as in dailybonus.json/turntable.json. Row TITLES and icons are not here — each activity has one '%n' title template in src/tasks.js, so adding tiers to an existing chain is a change to this file alone. The feature's GATE (unlockLevel) and the weekly reset weekday are NOT here — they live with every other key parameter in CONFIG.features.tasks, src/config.js.",

